          "284 − 280 = 4, and 4 is less than 5.",
          "So 284 ÷ 5 = 56 remainder 4."
        ],
        "answer": "56 r4"
      },
      "referenceExample": {
        "prompt": "Find 53 ÷ 6.",
        "steps": [
